    "notes": "<p><i>A massive worm as big as a capital ship. Found living on asteroids where it mimics a cave or mine waiting for unsuspecting spacers and denizens to enter its maw.</i></p><p><strong>Movement:</strong> DOUBLE NEAR (burrow)</p>",
    "description": "<p><strong>Attacks:</strong> 2 bite +9 (2d12 + swallow) and 1 thrash (1d10)</p><p>Ship</p><p><strong>Scale.</strong> This denizen is the size of a ship and attacks and damages as such.</p><p><strong>Swallow.</strong> On a natural attack roll of 18-20, target is swallowed. Total darkness inside and 2d10 damage per round. Dweller regurgitates all swallowed if dealt at least 20 damage in one round to the inside of its gullet.</p>",
